["I need to make 24 using 10, 4, 9, 7 with each number once.\n\nLet me try different combinations.\n\n10 + 4 + 9 + 7 = 30, no\n10 + 4 + 9 - 7 = 16, no\n10 + 4 - 9 + 7 = 12, no\n10 - 4 + 9 + 7 = 22, no\n10 + 4 * 9 - 7 = 10 + 36 - 7 = 39, no\n10 - 4 + 9 * 7 = 10 - 4 + 63 = 69, no\n(10 - 4) * (9 - 7) = 6 * 2 = 12, no\n(10 + 4) * (9 - 7) = 14 * 2 = 28, no\n(10 - 7) * (9 - 4) = 3 * 5 = 15, no\n(10 - 7) * 9 - 4 = 27 - 4 = 23, no\n(10 - 7) * 9 + 4 = 27 + 4 = 31, no\n(10 - 7) * 8 = ... no 8\n(9 - 7) * 10 + 4 = 20 + 4 = 24! Yes!\n\nLet me verify: (9 - 7) * 10 + 4 = 2 * 10 + 4 = 20 + 4 = 24. \n\nUses 9, 7, 10, 4 - each once. \n\nSo the answer is (9 - 7) * 10 + 4.\n"]